#basePath Chapter12

::OnContractSelectOpenCh12
@trigger 
@cutscene 
@once 

{@PlayerInjured}   Well, that could've gone better.
{@PlayerInjured}   Just one more contract.
{@PlayerInjured}   Then I'm done with Frontier. For good.


::BeforeSupplyChain12

@trigger 
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene 
@once 

{@Quinn}   Hey, Cowboy. Heads up. Frontier's security checkpoints are heating up the shipping lanes.
{@Quinn}   It's the real Wild West out here.
{@PlayerInjured}   Dorian's searching for Keela.
{@Quinn}   Well, he's stopping just about everybody.
{@PlayerInjured}   Any way around them?
{@Quinn}   Sure, if you're willing to take a few chances.
    



::AfterFabrication12 
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply), IsSolutionFoundFor(Fabrication)
@cutscene
@once

// Incoming call from Callie

{@Callie}   Hey, Clacky! Heard you've been giving the big boss trouble!
{@PlayerInjured}   Callie? Where are you?
{@Callie}   Somewhere no one can find us!
{@PlayerInjured}   Us?
{@Keela}   <i>Callie, is that Locke?</i>
{@PlayerInjured}   Keela?! You're with Callie?
{@Keela}   Bro!
{@Keela}   It's nice to see your face!
{@PlayerInjured}   ...
{@PlayerInjured}   I've been trying to reach you...
{@PlayerInjured}   ...for months.
{@Keela}   Yeah...
{@Keela}   ...I wasn't sure whose side you were on.
{@PlayerInjured}   ...
{@Callie}   Hate to break up the family reunion, but we can't stay on this line!
{@Keela}   Sorry, Locke. We'll talk soon.
{@Callie}   Later, Clacky!

// Call ends


::PayDebt12
@trigger    OnGoalCompleted
@when       goalId == "Goal1"
@cutscene
@once

{@PlayerInjured}   That's it! I've got enough to pay off Frontier!
//show money clearing and debt marker disappearing
{@PlayerInjured}   <i>Gulp</i>. And now I'm broke.
{@PlayerInjured}   But no one can take the Constantine from me!
{@PlayerInjured}   Except for pirates... bad luck, and everything else.
{@PlayerInjured}   I'm calling Arken. Let's see if we can get what's left of our old crew back together.
